        "original_id": "a6472207-47ab-5107-8a41-0324f6bd6bc4",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Leonard Cohen, Ira Nadel\n- Works: Various Positions, Various Positions (album), Leonard Cohen biography\n- Topics: film title origin, lack of affiliation\n\nFacts:\n- Leonard Cohen was born on September 21, 1934, and died on November 7, 2016.\n- Leonard Cohen was a Canadian singer, songwriter, musician, poet, novelist, and painter.\n- The film Various Positions takes its title from Leonard Cohen's album Various Positions.\n- The film Various Positions also takes its title from Ira Nadel's biography of Leonard Cohen.\n- Leonard Cohen is not the subject of the film Various Positions.\n- Leonard Cohen had no affiliation with the film Various Positions.",
